Description: F-Pulse OSS — local-first data pipeline studio
 F-Pulse OSS is a self-hosted, local-first data pipeline tool by
 Hybridyn. Build, schedule, and observe ETL/ELT pipelines from a
 browser UI on your own machine — no cloud account required.
 .
 Includes a frozen Python runtime so no system Python install is
 required. The service is registered as a systemd user unit on
 first launch, so it auto-starts when you log in.
 .
 Open http://localhost:8001 after install.
